&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; looking for an experienced financial markets lawyer who can &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;operate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; as a trusted adviser to the business from day one. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;You’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; lead complex negotiations, advise senior stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and take ownership of significant legal &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;matters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; in a fast-moving environment where &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;your&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; advice has &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;direct commercial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;72d9cead-5d7c-511f-a089-41bc1b2ad175|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[335559740,&amp;quot;253&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Arial,Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;22&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;Body text Optiver&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;BodytextOptiver&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Zsysbasis Optiver&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;As a Senior Legal &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Counsel,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; will work closely with trading, compliance, risk, finance, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and technology teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;. You will support the businesses and trading desks covered by the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Legal &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Europe &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;team, including our European listed derivatives, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;commodities,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and systematic trading businesses. The role is primarily focused on listed markets and market infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Proximity to trading is fundamental to the way we work. You will partner directly with traders and business leaders, developing a deep understanding of the products, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;markets,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and commercial &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;objectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; of the desks you support. Experience advising on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;relevant &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;trading products or market structures will be a significant advantage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Leading legal support for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;key &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;business initiatives and acting as the primary legal adviser to assigned trading desks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
