&lt;p data-start=&quot;1812&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;✔ Have experience in a phone-based or customer-facing role (sales, support, retail, hospitality, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1918&quot; data-end=&quot;1981&quot;&gt;✔ Feel confident engaging business owners and decision-makers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1983&quot; data-end=&quot;2064&quot;&gt;✔ Are curious about fintech and motivated to understand the Dutch SMB landscape&lt;/p&gt;
